e/state transport, and properly-infinite trace-obstruction theorems.\nNo source theorem contains `sorry`, `admit`, or a user-declared axiom.  The\nblueprint build output is kept under `/tmp`, not in this source project.\n\n--- review/handoff listing ---\nAristotleCandidates/AlgebraicLimitOperatorRepresentation.lean\nAristotleCandidates/BicommutantNormalTransport.lean\nAristotleCandidates/BicommutantVonNeumannCore.lean\nAristotleCandidates/BoundedStateGNS.lean\nAristotleCandidates/CStarAlphaGNSBridge.lean\nAristotleCandidates/CStarCompletionAlphaInterface.lean\nAristotleCandidates/CStarGNSBridge.lean\nAristotleCandidates/CStarInductiveLimitFeasibility.lean\nAristotleCandidates/CStarTracialWeightCore.lean\nAristotleCandidates/CStarTransport.lean\nAristotleCandidates/CenterFiniteProjectionCore.lean\nAristotleCandidates/CoherentLocalHyperbolicCoordinates.lean\nAristotleCandidates/ConcreteCStarCompletion.lean\nAristotleCandidates/ConcreteQuasilocalCStarModel.lean\nAristotleCandidates/ConstructedAlgebraicAlpha.lean\nAristotleCandidates/DensityPartialTrace.lean\nAristotleCandidates/FiniteAdaptedCoordinateStarEquiv.lean\nAristotleCandidates/FiniteCoordinateEquivCoherence.lean\nAristotleCandidates/FiniteCoordinateFactorization.lean\nAristotleCandidates/FiniteCoordinateMapNormControl.lean\nAristotleCandidates/FiniteDensityMatrix.lean\nAristotleCandidates/FiniteModelSanity.lean\nAristotleCandidates/FinitePauliOrthogonality.lean\nAristotleCandidates/FiniteProductStateCoherence.lean\nAristotleCandidates/FinitePureFactor.lean\nAristotleCandidates/FiniteStabilizerDimension.lean\nAristotleCandidates/FiniteStabilizerProductState.lean\nAristotleCandidates/FiniteStabilizerProjector.lean\nAristotleCandidates/GNSCommutantConjugation.lean\nAristotleCandidates/GNSUnitaryIntertwiner.lean\nAristotleCandidates/GeneralLatticeProjectionTower.lean\nAristotleCandidates/InfiniteAlgebraicRegionalEquiv.lean\nAristotleCandidates/InfiniteAlgebraicStateTransport.lean\nAristotleCandidates/LayeredDirect